// VibeMail — agentic mail, rebuilt from the warm-paper web reference
// (UI设计-新/app: light #f3f1e6 paper ground by default with forest-green
// #2f5d43 accent; dark theme #161c1a ground with mint #8fcb9b accent; teal
// data accent, AI priority meters, label chips, Agent squad). Layout per the
// reference: a 264px full sidebar (brand / gradient compose CTA / nav with
// badges / mailbox folders / AI clusters / agent mini card), a 60px top bar
// (title, agent search, VIBE AGENT pill, theme toggle, bell), and per-view
// bodies — 智能收件箱 = 420px list + in-place reading pane whose collapsible
// inline AI 速览 carries summary / 待办提取 / 语气洞察; AI 写信 = centred
// composer card + 340px COMPOSE WITH AI rail; Agent 小队 = stats, squad
// cards, autonomy dial, live activity stream. The reply lifecycle lives on
// the mail itself (draft -> confirm -> sending -> sent / failed -> retry) so
// every surface reads one state. AI summary and drafting call the host's
// one-shot model service (model.complete, OctoSense#95) with a
// schema-checked answer; where nothing answers "model" (card-host) the app
// says so and falls back to labelled practice content. Mail data and sends
// are practice data until a platform mail service answers.

// ---- state ---------------------------------------------------------------
let screen = "inbox"          // inbox | write | agents (desktop: reading is
                              // a selection in the inbox's master-detail)
let current = 0
let selected = false          // no mail focused -> placeholder pane
let filter = "all"            // all | urgent | reply | later
let brief_open = true         // reading pane's inline AI 速览 collapsible
let folder = "inbox"          // inbox | starred | later | sent | drafts | archive | trash
                              // — the sidebar 邮箱 folders are REAL filters
let cluster_sel = ""          // "" | 工作 | 财务 | 订阅 | 社交 — AI 智能分类 filter
let pop = ""                  // "" | bell | cal | set — chrome popover panels
                              // (named `pop`: `panel` is the palette colour)
let mail_arm = false          // settings: 断开邮箱 needs a second confirming tap

